1. Introduction. {

.unnumbered}
================

The purpose of this paper is to introduce the notion of graded comodule categories with enough projectives [@batanin2017graded], a generalization of the usual notion of comodule categories with enough injectives [@dayStrang; @johnstone; @weber], and to study some of their properties.
